Package: com.huhansibuxin.swiftgramnobgcpu
Name: SwiftgramNoBgCPU
Depends: mobilesubstrate, ellekit
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Kill Swiftgram background CPU. Hooks UIApplication beginBackgroundTask
 and returns UIBackgroundTaskInvalid whenever the app is not in the foreground,
 so the system suspends it immediately after leaving the app instead of letting
 Postbox TimeBasedCleanupScan burn a core in the background task window.
Maintainer: huhansibuxin
Author: huhansibuxin
Section: Tweaks
